%% Sprint coach-page-reform-1 — Sequencia de persistencia da aba via ?tab=
%% Cobre: load inicial, deep-link, switch click, refresh, browser back/forward.
%% Hook central: useTabFromUrl(validTabs, defaultTab).

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Usuario
    participant B as Browser URL bar
    participant W as Wouter useLocation
    participant H as useTabFromUrl
    participant G as GradePlanner
    participant T as Tabs Radix

    Note over U,T: Cenario A — Load inicial sem ?tab=
    U->>B: GET /coach
    B->>W: location = "/coach"
    W->>H: useSearch() = ""
    H->>H: parse vazio → fallback default "planner"
    H->>G: activeTab = "planner"
    G->>T: render Tabs value=planner
    T-->>U: aba Planner exibida

    Note over U,T: Cenario B — Deep-link ?tab=variance
    U->>B: GET /coach?tab=variance
    B->>W: location = "/coach", search = "?tab=variance"
    W->>H: useSearch() = "tab=variance"
    H->>H: validTabs.includes("variance") → ok
    H->>G: activeTab = "variance"
    G->>T: render Tabs value=variance
    T-->>U: PrimedopePanel renderiza (lazy mount)

    Note over U,T: Cenario C — User clica aba Flights
    U->>T: click coach-tab-flights
    T->>G: onValueChange("flights")
    G->>H: setActiveTab("flights")
    H->>B: history.replaceState(null, "", "/coach?tab=flights")
    H->>G: activeTab = "flights"
    G->>T: render Tabs value=flights
    T-->>U: FlightsPanel exibido (URL atualizada sem reload)

    Note over U,T: Cenario D — Refresh F5 em /coach?tab=flights
    U->>B: F5 reload
    B->>W: location = "/coach", search = "?tab=flights"
    W->>H: useSearch() = "tab=flights"
    H->>G: activeTab = "flights"
    G->>T: render Tabs value=flights
    T-->>U: aba Flights preservada

    Note over U,T: Cenario E — Back/forward do navegador
    U->>B: click back (historico tem /coach?tab=variance)
    B->>W: popstate event → location update
    W->>H: useSearch reage a search novo
    H->>G: activeTab = "variance"
    G->>T: render Tabs value=variance
    T-->>U: aba Variance exibida<br/>(nota: replaceState evitou poluicao mas back<br/>volta para a entry anterior do historico — outra rota)

    Note over U,T: Cenario F — Param invalido ?tab=foobar
    U->>B: GET /coach?tab=foobar
    B->>W: search = "?tab=foobar"
    W->>H: useSearch() = "tab=foobar"
    H->>H: validTabs.includes("foobar") = false
    H->>B: history.replaceState para "/coach" (limpa)
    H->>G: activeTab = default "planner"
    G->>T: render Tabs value=planner
    T-->>U: fallback exibido + URL limpa
